   167	    /// The case the thresholds are tuned against, on the real catalog: a Life
   168	    /// Fitness Insignia chest press shares "Insignia Series" and its brand with
   169	    /// five stablemates. The right row must be preselected and stand clear of
   170	    /// them, or a misread of the single distinguishing word ("Chest") would
